# --- local run output -------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: /evidence/ is committed on purpose — it is a required deliverable (§6).
# What is ignored here is the noisy local debugging output that is NOT evidence:
# Playwright traces embed un-redacted DOM snapshots and cannot be masked after
# capture, so they must never reach a public repo.
#
# ANCHORED to the repo root (/runs/, not runs/): an unanchored pattern matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, so `runs/` silently swallowed
# evidence/runs/ — the required deliverable — out of the first commit.
/runs/
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
trace.zip
*.webm

